      "title": "README - read this first",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Contest-compliant beat reactor\n\n**H3 writes the score.** There is no `LoadAudio` in this graph - the soundtrack is decoded out of H3's own audio latent, which is what *'H3-generated synced audio'* asks for.\n\nThe apparent deadlock (you cannot react to audio that does not exist yet) is resolved by the two passes: H3 makes both streams at once in pass 1, then pass 2 reacts to what it made.\n\nThe prompt names **percussive** sound on purpose. Ask for 'soothing ambient rumble' and H3 writes a pad with no transients, beat detection finds nothing, and every reaction downstream sits flat."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
