      "widgets_values": [
        "Cinematic, hyper-detailed 8K macro-wide view inside a subterranean ocean abyss. The camera pushes slowly through a field of millions of floating bioluminescent micro-plankton glowing in soft cyan. A colossal cyber-organic leviathan whale glides forward from the dark indigo void, its skin patterned with turquoise and violet neural bioluminescence channels. On every low pulse the light channels across its throat and ventral pleats flare hard and volumetric turquoise beams stab through the water; delicate glass jellyfish flash in counterpoint and pressure rings ripple outward.\n\nAudio: a slow, heavy percussive pulse - deep concussive sub-bass booms on a steady beat, sharp metallic sonar pings echoing between them, sudden transient clicks and hits, over a bed of resonant whale song and ocean rumble. Rhythmic and punchy, with clear silence between each strike.",
        672,
        384,
        124
      ],
