      "title": "Beat brain",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Beat brain - reading what H3 just wrote\n\n`beat_locations` finds downbeats; `PeakDetector` isolates strikes; `Smoothing` (exponential, 0.40) gives each a ring-out so the bioluminescence swells rather than strobing on one frame.\n\n**Check the PreviewFeature plots.** If they are flat, H3 wrote a pad and no amount of downstream tuning will help - go back and make the prompt's audio line more percussive."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
