      "title": "Mask emitter",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Mask Emitter -> particle sim\n\nRyan's particle sim takes its length from whatever MASK it is handed (`num_frames = masks.shape[0]`). Hand it a `LoadImage` and the entire simulation collapses to **one frame**, silently, and the audio modulation feeding it is computed and thrown away.\n\n`H3 Mask Emitter` is the seed: it emits a batch of a known length, and with a `latent` connected it takes the count straight from the clip, so the two can never drift apart."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
